# Implementation Plan - Dynamic Option Exit Prices, Expiry Session Tracking & Data Integrity Audit

This plan addresses the two core issues reported:
1. **Replacing the hardcoded `$100.00` option close price** during market square-off with live real-time Binance Option Mark Prices (or intrinsic value calculation if expired).
2. **Adding explicit Binance Expiry Session Date tracking** (`expiry_session`) to `HedgeSession` database schema & dashboard UI tables so every trade and session clearly displays its target expiry date (e.g., `260821` / `21-AUG-2026`).
3. **Auditing and eliminating any remaining mock/fallback data**, then clearing existing trade records for a clean, accurate start.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Option Closing Price**: During square-off, option SELL orders will now execute using live real-time mark prices fetched directly from Binance Options API (`eapi.binance.com/eapi/v1/mark`). If a contract has expired at square-off time, its value will be determined by exact intrinsic formula `max(0, strike - futures_mark)` for PUT and `max(0, futures_mark - strike)` for CALL.
> - **Trade History Reset**: To remove historical orders containing the hardcoded `$100.00` exit price, all Hedge trade records and paper wallet balances will be wiped clean for a fresh start.

